Texel offsets read from a register become OpCompositeConstruct + Offset, and a four-offset gather becomes four
one-offset gathers, instead of an OpConstantComposite + ConstOffset(s), which is invalid SPIR-V that SPIRV-Cross
rejects with a null pointer. Constant offsets are emitted exactly as before.
From nxnative (https://github.com/seedds/nxnative, MIT), commit b3f25a0; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

